📂 Data Models

I think we're missing a few important classes.

Vehicle
FactorySpecs
CurrentSpecs
MaintenanceRecord
Photo
Document
FuelLog
Reminder

Notice how each thing becomes its own object.

That keeps the code clean.


---

🛢 Fluids

Instead of just having a Fluids screen, I'd make a FluidSpec model.

FluidSpec
├── Category
├── Capacity
├── Factory Fluid
├── Current Fluid
├── Change Interval
├── Last Changed
└── Notes

Then we can reuse it for:

Engine oil

Transmission

Front differential

Rear differential

Coolant

Brake fluid

Power steering



