🔧 Modifications

I think this deserves its own class too.

Modification
├── Category
├── Name
├── Brand
├── Part Number
├── Installed Date
├── Mileage
├── Notes
└── Photos

That opens the door to showing users exactly what's been changed on their vehicle.


